85: /**
86:  * A {@link org.apache.flink.runtime.state.StateBackend} that stores its state in an embedded {@code
87:  * RocksDB} instance. This state backend can store very large state that exceeds memory and spills
88:  * to local disk. All key/value state (including windows) is stored in the key/value index of
89:  * RocksDB. For persistence against loss of machines, please configure a {@link
90:  * org.apache.flink.runtime.state.CheckpointStorage} instance for the Job.
91:  *
92:  * <p>The behavior of the RocksDB instances can be parametrized by setting RocksDB Options using the
93:  * methods {@link #setPredefinedOptions(PredefinedOptions)} and {@link
94:  * #setRocksDBOptions(RocksDBOptionsFactory)}.
95:  */
