559:     /**
560:      * Triggers an asynchronous snapshot of the keyed state backend from ForSt. This snapshot can be
561:      * canceled and is also stopped when the backend is closed through {@link #dispose()}. For each
562:      * backend, this method must always be called by the same thread.
563:      *
564:      * @param checkpointId The Id of the checkpoint.
565:      * @param timestamp The timestamp of the checkpoint.
566:      * @param streamFactory The factory that we can use for writing our state to streams.
567:      * @param checkpointOptions Options for how to perform this checkpoint.
568:      * @return Future to the state handle of the snapshot data.
569:      * @throws Exception indicating a problem in the synchronous part of the checkpoint.
570:      */
571:     @Nonnull
